stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Received
    Received --> Parsing: create index job
    Parsing --> Chunked: extract text and metadata
    Chunked --> Embedding: enqueue chunk vectors
    Embedding --> Writing: embeddings generated
    Writing --> ShadowReady: build new index version
    ShadowReady --> Validating: replay gold + shadow queries
    Validating --> Ready: quality and latency gates pass
    Validating --> Rollback: gates fail
    Ready --> Serving: route reads to new version
    Rollback --> [*]
    Serving --> [*]
